  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The technique of syntactic condensation",
     "texto": [
      "In academic texts and cultured press, authors prefer to compact relative subordinate clauses by embedding all their complements before the noun:",
      "- **Relative clause (with Relativsatz)**: **Die Artefakte, [die kürzlich von den Archäologen im Rheinland entdeckt wurden], sind wertvoll**.",
      "- **Attributive participial group (Partizipialgruppe)**: **Die [kürzlich von den Archäologen im Rheinland entdeckten] Artefakte sind wertvoll**.",
      "The participle II («entdeckten») moves into the final position of the adjectival block, just before the noun («Artefakte»), agreeing with it in gender, number and case."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Relative clause",
     "columnas": [
